{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "inv2veerguctpoxg", "title": "40.模型稀疏化的实践方法", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5cbc0004\" id=\"u5cbc0004\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua61d38f2\" id=\"ua61d38f2\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751690685508-89518e7e-d6c1-45d3-8869-cd50a7f84d30.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4d7f81b5-3f72-4154-9fa0-161a0199b78%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u172e3984-2617-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A556.2666666666667%2C%22height%22%3A309%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A142745%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1043%2C%22originHeight%22%3A579%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AD%94%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A161%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A135%2C%22width%22%3A173%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E7%8E%87%E5%9D%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A784%2C%22y%22%3A456%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A394%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%E5%B0%91%E9%87%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A782%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B4%9F%E8%BD%BD%E5%9D%87%E8%A1%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A399%2C%22y%22%3A455%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E8%BF%87%E8%BD%BD%22%2C%22x%22%3A782%2C%22y%22%3A515%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E5%85%A8%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A785%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A782%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A181%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A785%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%A8%80%E7%96%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A401%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf2ac5dab%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc56f7372\" id=\"uc56f7372\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62b02afe\" id=\"u62b02afe\">模型稀疏化（如Top-K路由）是MoE（Mixture of Experts）架构的核心技术，通过动态分配计算资源降低推理成本。其核心思路是：</span></p><ol list=\"ufb07dd09\"><li fid=\"ue9baf86a\" data-lake-id=\"u556438df\" id=\"u556438df\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u70318b16\" id=\"u70318b16\">动态路由</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u14d92334\" id=\"u14d92334\">：每个输入仅激活少量专家（如Top-2），避免全模型计算。</span></li><li fid=\"ue9baf86a\" data-lake-id=\"uff09e8a1\" id=\"uff09e8a1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6cab5966\" id=\"u6cab5966\">负载均衡</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud04b2b3a\" id=\"ud04b2b3a\">：通过损失函数约束专家利用率，防止少数专家过载。</span></li><li fid=\"ue9baf86a\" data-lake-id=\"uff81dd1c\" id=\"uff81dd1c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udf614de8\" id=\"udf614de8\">稀疏计算</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u48c0c4c2\" id=\"u48c0c4c2\">：仅激活部分参数，显著减少计算量和显存占用。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u6bcb739c\" id=\"u6bcb739c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0456ae26\" id=\"u0456ae26\">以下结合真实项目案例分点解析。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eRk92%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"6c12541a\" id=\"6c12541a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2d8e3e0d\" id=\"u2d8e3e0d\">二、项目案例</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ud4e66ee5\" id=\"ud4e66ee5\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751690711984-717b6dc1-3883-44b6-8fa0-89e6881adfd8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua3b2d648-17cc-4429-b2c6-1d10af29042%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u172e3984-2617-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A344.53333333333336%2C%22height%22%3A468%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A139458%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A646%2C%22originHeight%22%3A877%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A423%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%B2%BE%E5%BA%A6%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A457%2C%22y%22%3A403%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E9%A3%8E%E6%8E%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A238%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%22%2C%22x%22%3A457%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%83%E4%BA%BF%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A458%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%90%9E%E5%90%90%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A458%2C%22y%22%3A369%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BB%B6%E8%BF%9F%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A456%2C%22y%22%3A840%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22